    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Voice round-trip (use with week2/voice.html)\n\n1. Create an **HTTP Header Auth** credential for ElevenLabs:\n   - Name: `xi-api-key`\n   - Value: `YOUR_ELEVENLABS_API_KEY`\n2. Put a voice ID in the **ElevenLabs TTS** URL (replace `YOUR_VOICE_ID`). Find IDs in ElevenLabs -> Voices.\n3. Activate the workflow and copy the **Production URL** into `voice.html`.\n4. Record, send, and the browser plays the returned `audio/mpeg`.\n\nFlow: multipart audio -> STT (`text`) -> agent (`output`) -> TTS (binary `audio`) -> response.\n\nIf your ElevenLabs free plan blocks STT/TTS, use `04-elevenlabs-voice-bridge` instead.",
